The Exynos8895 PMU has the clock output at the usual PMU_DEBUG offset
with a 6-bit source select. On the Galaxy Note 8 it carries the 26 MHz
TCXO to the audio codec's MCLK1.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
